I think you've misdiagnosed the problem.

input <- list(factor = "am")

D <-  mtcars %>%
  group_by_(input$factor, "vs" )  %>%
  summarise_each(funs(sum), mpg)
D

Works fine, there is no problem mixing variable names stored in
variables with variable names entered directly as quoted character
vectors.

Best,
Ista

